# explainer-open (M11): the explainer's opening frame by frame, from the rest's deadline (the pointer
# onto a's chip at 2000 ms, the explainer at 2400): it comes out of its caret as the settings menu
# comes out of the gear (Callout.module.css), from 90 % about a point 80 px out past its caret's edge
# on the enter spring at its own pace (643 ms, CSS's linear() of it), fading in over 160 ms
# linearly. The plan's 0, 40, 80, 120, 160, 200 and 643 ms (each the last frame on the 16 ms grid:
# 32, 80, 112, 160, 192 and 640).
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 70 424
wait 400
shot open-0000
wait 40
shot open-0040
wait 40
shot open-0080
wait 40
shot open-0120
wait 40
shot open-0160
wait 40
shot open-0200
wait 443
shot open-0643
